{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半屏左上方两行最大号白色粗体标题首先吸引视线，随后中部两块同样醒目的白色粗体文字争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他担心有一天对方不再需要他的陪伴，甚至不愿意和他待在一起；是否已经看出他因此突然安静下来，不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"没底、不安，隐约害怕被对方不再需要。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他此刻突然安静、不敢继续往下想的具体反应；对方其实一直没有退开，两人仍然亲近，也许对方同样喜欢他的陪伴，因此他又有一点高兴。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的字争夺主视线：顶部标题、中部紫色竖线句子和绿色竖线句子都很突出。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里：顶部交代担忧的原因，中部才交代他突然安静的反应，需要拼起来理解。\",\n    \"单块太长、一块里有好几层意思：顶部标题包含不安和假设的被拒绝情境，中部绿色大字又包含回忆、判断和情绪变化。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "35bf827a-8599-4ebc-8167-f00726e2e195", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T025839595012Z", "elapsed_seconds": 32.734, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:59:12.331158+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "aa5fe74b6b1aa5ad875071f14f420714bdedf8037d4d9a8c869ad7adab7289c7", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8